  "text": "Our study has several limitations that should be addressed. First, the results are limited by the retrospective design and the small sample size. Although the only significantly different variable between the ICIs + RT group and the ICIs group was the line of chemoradiotherapy, inherent selection bias remains. Second, the lack of essential biomarker information, such as PD-L1 expression, is a significant limitation. Finally, a notable limitation of this study is its exclusive focus on patients with squamous cell carcinoma, which may limit the generalizability of the findings to adenocarcinoma or other non- squamous cell carcinoma subtypes.",
